<title>SPAIN: Spain Oct industrial production rose 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Oct industrial production rose 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute gave the following provisional figures (percentage change):</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION		  OCT 96   SEPT 96   OCT 95</p>
<p> Yr-yr					+6.1	 -0.8     3.4</p>
<p> Avg yr to date against yr ago	-0.8	 -1.6     6.0</p>
<p>The INE gave the following breakdown (percentage change):</p>
<p>					     OCT 96   SEPT 96 YR-TO-DATE</p>
<p> Energy				     0.8	-3.5	-0.6</p>
<p> Non-energy minerals, chemicals     6.7	-2.0	-2.3</p>
<p> Metals, precision tools	     12.0	 3.4	 2.5</p>
<p> Other manufacturing		    3.0	-2.4	-2.8</p>
<p> Consumer goods			   5.5	-3.7	-1.4</p>
<p> Capital goods			    7.9	 7.2	 3.2</p>
<p> Intermediary goods		     6.0	-0.9	-1.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Year-to-date column gives average increases.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
